{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for FinanceFlow', 'description': 'Primary container for FinanceFlow implementation: A single-user web expense tracker app built with ReactJS, enabling users to manage income and expenses, visualize financial data, set savings goals, and receive milestone notifications. The app features a minimalistic, responsive UI with dark/light mode, animated transitions, and persistent data storage using LocalStorage and optional Firebase integration. Email notifications are supported via emailJS. The design prioritizes usability, accessibility, and smooth user experience.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Transaction Management",\n      "description": "Add, edit, and delete income and expense transactions with categories, dates, amounts, and optional descriptions.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Transaction List & Filtering",\n      "description": "Display transactions in a list with filtering by category and date range.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Data Visualization",\n      "description": "Pie chart for expenses by category and line chart for income/expense trends over time.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Savings Goal & Progress Ring",\n      "description": "Set a savings goal and visualize progress with a circular progress ring. Show in-app notifications for milestones, which disappear after 3 seconds.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Onboarding Banner/Modal",\n      "description": "Show onboarding tips for first-time users via a banner or modal.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Dark/Light Mode Toggle",\n      "description": "Support dark and light themes with appropriate accent colors (dark purple/light purple, green for income, red for expenses).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Responsive Design",\n      "description": "Optimized for both mobile and desktop devices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Minimalistic UI & Animations",\n      "description": "Casual, minimalistic UI with Google-like buttons and smooth animated transitions for modals, notifications, and theme switching.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "LocalStorage Persistence",\n      "description": "Persist transactions, settings, and theme preferences in LocalStorage.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Firebase Integration (Optional)",\n      "description": "Optional backend integration for authentication and cloud storage.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "EmailJS Integration",\n      "description": "Send transactional or notification emails via emailJS.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Theme Switcher",\n      "description": "Toggleable theme switcher saved to user preferences.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Form Validation",\n      "description": "All forms (transactions, filters, goal setting) include proper validation.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Performance & Accessibility",\n      "description": "Optimized performance and adherence to accessibility best practices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Vite Build & Config",\n      "description": "Built with ReactJS and Vite, with vite.config.js configured for cloud-hosted domain access.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#6C2EBE",\n    "secondary": "#F5F6FA",\n    "accent": "#6C2EBE"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a top navigation bar with theme toggle and user settings. The main dashboard displays the onboarding banner/modal for new users, followed by a savings goal progress ring at the top. Below, a responsive grid shows the pie chart (expenses by category) and line chart (income/expense trends). The transaction list with filtering options is displayed beneath the charts. Floating action buttons allow adding new transactions or setting goals. In-app notifications appear as animated toasts at the top or bottom, disappearing after 3 seconds. The UI is minimalistic, with Google-like buttons, smooth transitions, and adapts seamlessly to mobile and desktop screens."\n}'}",
